    slug: 'dynamic-yield-mcp',
    name: 'Dynamic Yield (No MCP Server Available)',
    description: 'Dynamic Yield does not publish an MCP server, and no community server exists either — this entry documents the gap rather than linking a repository that is not there. What was checked: the GitHub Search API returns zero results for "dynamic yield mcp"; a broad `dynamicyield` search returns only unrelated artifacts (interview-task repos and an old iOS SDK mirror), none of them MCP servers; the `DynamicYield` GitHub organization exists but an `org:DynamicYield mcp` search returns nothing; and on npm `@dynamicyield/mcp-server`, `@dynamicyield/mcp`, `dynamic-yield-mcp` and `dy-mcp-server` all 404. A web search of the vendor\'s own documentation — the method that has surfaced several undocumented vendor-hosted servers elsewhere in this directory — turned up no Dynamic Yield MCP endpoint either. There is a genuinely relevant adjacent option, however. Dynamic Yield was acquired by Mastercard, and Mastercard does ship an official MCP server: `@mastercard/developers-mcp`, built from the MIT-licensed Mastercard/developers-agent-toolkit repository. It is a documentation server — it lets an AI agent read and reason over Mastercard\'s developer docs, guides and API specifications, and can be scoped to a single service with a `--service=` flag — so it will not drive Dynamic Yield campaigns, audiences or recommendation units. Treat it as a way to work against Mastercard platform APIs with an assistant, not as personalization tooling. For agent-driven experimentation and personalization work available today, this directory\'s verified alternatives are the official PostHog MCP Server (feature flags, experiments, session replay, ad-hoc analytics), the Optimizely Experimentation MCP Server, and the AB Tasty MCP Server. Dynamic Yield does operate a documented Experience APIs platform, so a community wrapper is buildable — nobody has published one. This entry will be upgraded to a real listing the moment a maintained server appears.',
